WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.000
Home of the heaviest stars known.

00:02.799 --> 00:10.270
At its heart is R136, a cluster under two million years old whose light makes most of the nebula glow.

00:10.840 --> 00:15.075
Its brightest star is among the heaviest known, two to three hundred Suns.

00:15.736 --> 00:18.756
The stars drawn are a sample, at its real place.
